  "id": "transdermal-patch",
  "term": "transdermal patch",
  "definition": "In this study, a transdermal patch was a patch presented as containing Ginkgo and applied as a placebo. It was used to create expectations and examine possible effects on mood, cognitive performance, and stress-related psychophysiological responses.",
